Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='cheapgate', at=datetime(2026, 11, 4, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title='Testing a pull request is cheap: a smoke per train, the full gate nightly', body="A train runs the tree half on GitHub's runners and a live smoke on the box. The full gate, both halves, runs nightly on master (scripts/train.sh nightly, at 01:43 UTC) and files a todo when it is red. Expensive steps are keyed by what they read, so a pull request reruns only what it can break, and the box substitutes what the tree half built instead of building it again. Trains carry three to five pull requests.", rationale='The owner, 2026-11-04: testing a pull request should be cheap.', supersedes=()))